  "otbor.truth.role.10": "Builder, tester",
  "otbor.truth.role.11": "Decorated the maze and hospital, placed the bushes",
  "otbor.truth.role.12": "Built the maze and vines, then decorated",
  "otbor.truth.role.13": "Got bored and decided to build this mess",
