  "otbor.truth.comment.0": "Fired everyone in the middle of the project.",
  "otbor.truth.comment.1": "I dreamed about building the maze. I'm traumatized.",
  "otbor.truth.comment.2": "We're tired, help us...",
  "otbor.truth.comment.3": "I'm exhausted, please send green healing potions!!!",
  "otbor.truth.comment.4": "I'm a sentient plant, an engineer who's very, very tired",
