  "otbor.truth.comment.12": "I did what I was told; after the event, we'll launch Hiroshima at this maze.",
  "otbor.truth.comment.13": "They worked me hard (building). P.S. Waiting for the nukes after all this)",
  "otbor.truth.comment.14": "A physicist who bought a 70k keyboard. Who am I?",
